  "summary_en": "European Commission AI Watch country report on Switzerland's approach to AI. Switzerland has no national AI strategy; the 2019 Interdepartmental Working Group report and 2020 federal AI guidelines recommend keeping the general regulatory framework with sectoral adaptations, covering skills, research, health, finance, agriculture and autonomous mobility.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Switzerland does not plan a national AI strategy; it promotes framework conditions instead.",
   "2019 Working Group report sets policy actions across 17 thematic fields.",
   "Federal AI guidelines adopted November 2020 for the federal administration.",
   "Recommends keeping the general regulatory framework with sectoral adaptations (media, mobility, health).",
   "Road Traffic Act and Railways Act revisions are under way for automated vehicles."
